---
description: AILabel marks AI-generated content and opens a callout that explains how AI was used.
---

<script>
  import { AILabel, Button, Link, Stack, Text } from "carbon-components-svelte";
  import View from "carbon-icons-svelte/lib/View.svelte";
  import FolderOpen from "carbon-icons-svelte/lib/FolderOpen.svelte";

  let reverted = false;
</script>

Place an `AILabel` next to content an AI model generated or changed. Its button opens a callout; put the explanation in the default slot.

## Basic

<AILabel>
  <Text type="label-01" color="secondary">AI explained</Text>
  <Text type="heading-05">84%</Text>
  <Text type="label-01" color="secondary">Confidence score</Text>
  <Text>This forecast was generated by a model trained on the last 12 months of usage.</Text>
  <Link href="#">Learn more</Link>
</AILabel>

## Sizes

Set `size` to `"mini"`, `"2xs"`, `"xs"` (default), `"sm"`, `"md"`, `"lg"`, or `"xl"`.

<Stack orientation="horizontal" gap={5}>
  <AILabel size="mini"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  <AILabel size="2xs"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  <AILabel size="xs"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  <AILabel size="sm"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  <AILabel size="md"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  <AILabel size="lg"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  <AILabel size="xl"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
</Stack>

## Inline

Set `kind` to `"inline"` for a label that sits next to text. Inline labels use `sm`, `md`, or `lg`. Set `textLabel` to add text after the AI text.

<Stack gap={5}>
  <Stack orientation="horizontal" gap={5}>
    <AILabel kind="inline" size="sm"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
    <AILabel kind="inline" size="md"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
    <AILabel kind="inline" size="lg"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
  </Stack>
  <AILabel kind="inline" size="md" textLabel="Text goes here"><Text>Generated by AI.</Text></AILabel>
</Stack>

## Actions

Put buttons in the `actions` slot. They sit in a bar along the bottom of the callout; a primary button goes last.

<AILabel>
  <Text type="label-01" color="secondary">AI explained</Text>
  <Text>Five tickets were grouped by a model that compares their titles and stack traces.</Text>
  <svelte:fragment slot="actions">
    <Button kind="ghost" size="small" iconOnly icon={View} iconDescription="View" />
    <Button kind="ghost" size="small" iconOnly icon={FolderOpen} iconDescription="Open folder" />
    <Button size="small">View details</Button>
  </svelte:fragment>
</AILabel>

## Revert

Set `revertActive` after a user edits an AI-generated value. The label becomes a button that dispatches `revert`, so the user can restore the AI value.

<Stack orientation="horizontal" gap={5} align="center">
  <AILabel revertActive={!reverted} on:revert={() => (reverted = true)}>
    <Text>Generated by AI.</Text>
  </AILabel>
  <Button kind="tertiary" size="small" on:click={() => (reverted = !reverted)}>
    {reverted ? "Edit the value" : "Restore"}
  </Button>
</Stack>
